{"unit_id":"tag:036K:proof","translation":"由于平坦性（flatness）是用局部环（local rings）的映射（maps）定义的（态射（Morphisms），定义<REF_0001>），所需证明的是下面的代数事实：设<MATH_0001>是局部环（local rings）的局部同态（homomorphisms），并假设<MATH_0002>平坦（flat）。则<MATH_0003>平坦（flat）当且仅当<MATH_0004>平坦（flat）。若<MATH_0005>平坦（flat），则<MATH_0006>平坦（flat），见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0002>。反过来，假设<MATH_0007>平坦（flat）。注意<MATH_0008>忠实平坦（faithfully flat），见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0003>。因此<MATH_0009>平坦（flat），见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0004>。（直接证明也可参见态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0005>。）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"homomorphisms","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"平坦性的局部环定义；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"局部环间的映射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"环映射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"homomorphisms","target_term":"同态","context":"局部环同态；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"环同态的平坦性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"忠实平坦环同态；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03X4:proof","translation":"我们将使用引理<REF_0001>。由态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>，局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）在源和目标上均为Zariski局部。由态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>，可知将局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）态射（morphism）与一个平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）作前复合（precomposition），所得态射仍为局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism），使得<MATH_0003>局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）。则<MATH_0004>为有限型（finite type）的，且由引理<REF_0005>可知<MATH_0005>也为有限型（finite type）的。此外，由假设，<MATH_0006>具有有限（finite）纤维（fibres），因而<MATH_0007>也具有有限（finite）纤维（fibres）。我们得到<MATH_0008>拟有限（quasi-finite），见态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0006>。这就证明了引理<REF_0007>的最后一个假设，从而完成证明。","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"precomposition","target_term":"前复合"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"quasi-finite","target_term":"拟有限"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限","context":"态射的局部拟有限性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"概形态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"平展态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"precomposition","target_term":"前复合","context":"前复合下性质保持；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"仿射概形间的态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"满射态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"态射的有限型性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"纤维的有限性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"态射纤维；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-finite","target_term":"拟有限","context":"拟有限态射；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
